WEBVTT

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:07.170
The last unwinged Sekirei is located in the Northern area.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.760
They're all going to gather here.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.720
The Ashikabi wanting to wing the last Sekirei will all gather here!

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.540
As the Sekirei Guardian...

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.100
I'm going to kill Minaka and bring about an end to this ridiculous game!

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:38.350
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:38.350
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:45.440
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:45.440
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:52.280
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:52.280
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:58.460
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:58.460
I will believe in your smile

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.670
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.670
If I can protect your dream,

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.260
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.260
I will even embrace pain

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:15.560
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:15.560
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:22.310
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:22.310
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:30.530
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:27.110
yes, my passion accelerates

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:30.530
as if it were rushing through my body

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:36.700
aa, donna unmei datte

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:36.700
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:47.840
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:41.000
yes, I can fly high over it

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.840
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:58.490
Fifth Wing

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:58.490
The Fire Sekirei

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:04.600
Minato, why would you keep something like this a secret from us?!

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.790
I fell asleep in the bathtub.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:05.550
What's going on?

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:05.550
I'm totally surprised!

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.850
No, like I said...

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.590
What's with the commotion?

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.010
Even I had no idea about this, but...

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:14.520
Apparently, Minato-san swings <i>that way</i>,
and he wouldn't even apologize to Kagari-san...

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:15.670
Excuse me?

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.030
Oh my...

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.790
All of you gathered here in such shameful outfits...

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:23.900
Bath towel festivals are forbidden in the Izumo Inn.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.730
Kagari-san's chest...

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.000
They were definitely soft...

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:36.120
Even his figure resembles that of a female...

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:39.750
Onii-chan...?

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.430
Wait a second!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.030
Wouldn't this make me <i>that</i>?

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:46.920
But I'm certain they were... boobs...

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.550
Boobs?

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:49.560
Eh?!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.690
Never mind, it's nothing!

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.200
I wonder what Kagari-san really is...

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.000
Just now, I...

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.520
was almost killed by him...

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.560
Does he hate me after all?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.040
But...

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.660
There is something I <i>am</i> certain about.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.900
He's a Sekirei.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:20.960
Missed call?

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.540
20 times?

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.660
What is it, Takami-san?

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.580
The Guardian is resting-

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:32.840
Ah, I'm finally able to contact you.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:33.510
Run away.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.910
No, actually...

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.010
Listen carefully...

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:38.730
Don't even step out from Izumo Inn.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.440
What do you mean?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.640
Did something happen?

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.150
Well, actually...

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.090
Um, it's me, Sahashi...

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.980
What is it? What do you want?

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:53.000
Kagari, is anyone there?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.200
You see...

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.730
I-I received a message.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.710
F-From M.B.I.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.120
Saying "First come, first serve..."

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:01.870
First come, first serve?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.100
What is this about?

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.630
I-It says...

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.560
It says "the one to wing her could be you," or something...

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.610
That the last unwinged Sekirei is in the Northern area...

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.480
I-I think I understand!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.050
...Probably.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:16.880
You're a Sekirei, right, Kagari-san?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:17.860
That's why I...

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.390
Hello? What's wrong?

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:21.810
So, what's your point?

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.380
Eh? Um...

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:27.460
Do you intend to be... the first one to do it with a triumphant look?

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.810
K-Kagari-san...?

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.560
You're wrong!

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:31.930
Then what is it?

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.110
What are your intentions?

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.910
I-I'm just worried...

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:40.330
I don't need any of your pathetic sympathy!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:48.010
I'm sorry, Takami-san...

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.170
I'm going to kill Minaka.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:52.580
What-  Wait up, Kagari!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.380
Kagar-

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:57.640
Kagari-san?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.110
Kagari-san!

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:05.900
Kagari-sa-

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.020
Kagari-san...?

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.220
Isn't Takami...?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.480
The final unwinged, huh?

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.400
Shiina, could this be...?

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.780
It might be Kuu.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:28.820
Let's go, Shiina.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:31.890
Yes?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.120
Listen to me, Kagari!

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.790
Don't do anything stupid!

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:37.120
So it really is Mom...

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.620
Are you listening, Kagari?!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.760
E-Excuse me...

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:40.830
Huh?

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.850
Is that... Minato?

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.850
Y-Yeah, um...

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:45.750
Where's Kagari?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.940
Well... he's gone.

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:50.790
He shouldn't be out right now!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:51.610
Huh?

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.610
What's the matter?

00:05:56.610 --> 00:06:00.070
It was quite hectic just now, and I didn't sense anything strange, but...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.490
Why was a fire burning over there?

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.420
Now that you mention it, it sure was quite odd.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.410
I can't believe that Homura would actually make his appearance...

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:10.420
Homura?

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:15.480
I first encountered him engulfed in fire.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.920
What are you fighting for without a master?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:24.430
Instead of worrying about me, you should hurry up and find your own master to protect.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:25.930
That's Homura.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:29.870
Tsukiumi-san, were you getting fried up?

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.800
I-I just happened to let my guard down at first.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.320
Let me help you with the zipper on your back.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.140
Oh, thanks.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:39.650
I was just caught unprepared that time! That's all.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:44.660
Ever since then, whenever we met face to face, he was the stronger one.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.330
He was probably the strongest among the unwinged.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.290
Hasn't he been winged yet?

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:53.810
I haven't seen him around lately, so I wouldn't know right now.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.710
Anyway, he's a creep!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:59.760
He was wearing a bottom-half mask, like this.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:01.430
A mask?

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:05.680
I caught a glimpse of his face just once,

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:09.890
but I'm not too fond of staring at someone who was just beaten down.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:11.310
A mask...

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:15.230
However, recently, I've been having the feeling that he's close by...

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:19.030
Actually, it feels more like I get to see him every day.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:23.410
Oh, a man with a mask! I've met him before!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.940
At that time, I mistook him for Kagari-san.

00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:29.130
Kagari?

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.430
Well, they look alike from the back, so...

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.980
They really do resemble each other...

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.500
Minato had the same mysterious flame surrounding him...

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:37.710
Wait...!

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:42.130
Now that I think about it, I've heard that Homura was the only Sekirei using fire...

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.050
Don't tell me...

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:46.510
It can't be...

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.400
Homura!!!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.320
Gosh, she found out.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.240
K-Kagari san is the final unwinged one...?

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:04.460
Right, the final unwinged was Homura,

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.530
Sekirei No. 06.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.090
Kagari has been keeping up a different appearance at Izumo Inn.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:13.120
He's currently the last wingable Sekirei.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.250
Stop him...

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.310
Stop him right now!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:20.130
He's planning on finishing himself off once he kills Minaka!

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:22.970
Um, what do you mean by killing Minaka?

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:27.390
Well, I wouldn't mind if he killed Minaka several times over, though.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:28.480
Mom...

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.800
Anyway, you're the only one I can depend on right now.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:32.790
I'm counting on you...

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.570
Even if you tell me that you depend on me...

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.260
Homura!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.410
Minato!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:51.200
Why the hell are you in Homura's room?!

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.990
Eh?! Um, you see...

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:59.170
D-Don't tell me you were doing <i>that</i> with Homura!

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:00.300
I wasn't!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.670
C-Calm down!

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:04.720
It seems the time's finally come, eh?

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.680
Matsu-san...?

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.850
Are you saying that he's reacting to an Ashikabi?

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:13.020
Y-Yeah... Unless I'm misunderstanding something here...

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:15.150
Damn you, Homura!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:19.550
And he even gave me that terrible sermon about getting an Ashikabi and getting winged myself...

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:23.440
I'm sorry, I was told to keep it a secret as well.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:23.920
Huh?

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.070
It's more like Tsukiumi-tan was too slow to notice.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.860
Wh-What is Tsukiumi so mad about?

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:35.250
It seems Tsukiumi-san and Kagari-san have met each other before.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.560
So then, what's going on right now?

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:42.350
Right now, many Ashikabi are gathering in the Northern area.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.550
I came over here to warn Homura-tan...

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.220
But I didn't expect him to go outside by himself...

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.510
What's going to happen if someone finds him?

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:55.180
Should he get captured by an Ashikabi,
he'd most likely get winged against his will.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.840
Even if he somehow manages to get past everyone here,

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.940
and reaches M.B.I.,

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.060
the only thing awaiting him in the main branch will be the Disciplinary Squad.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:08.070
The Disciplinary Squad...?

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.140
Minato!

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:12.710
Y-Yes?!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:16.050
Homura really is reacting to you, correct?

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.170
I-It was just like with the others.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.600
I can't explain this very well,

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:24.590
but this feeling in my chest, it's as if we were connected at the heart.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:27.050
One.

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:27.970
Two.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.020
Three.

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:29.940
Four.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:31.310
Five.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:36.610
This won't be interesting at all if his number of Sekirei keeps increasing at this rate.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:37.930
However...

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.080
Right now, we need to put this conflict aside.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:44.400
Even I don't want to lose a rival like this one.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.570
It's uninteresting, but...

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:48.480
T-Tsukiumi?

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:50.440
At this point...

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.160
Having five or six makes no difference!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.510
Minato!

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:55.240
You may take Homura!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.010
I, as your legal wife, shall allow it!

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:07.840
Minato, go and wing Homura!

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:10.760
By "wing"... you mean kiss?!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:13.220
Wait- Kiss?!

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:18.140
The number of Sekirei you possess does not matter...

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:23.430
What matters is the ability of an Ashikabi and the number of his wives!

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.320
This somehow sounds pitiful...

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:28.990
Wh-What do the rest of you think?

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.440
No problem at all here!

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:34.030
It's fine, isn't it? He's reacting to you, after all.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:36.150
Kagari-san is a good man!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.540
B-But, Kagari-san is still a man!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:43.000
Oh my, you must be straight if you're so worried about his gender.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.300
Straight?

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.240
Is that something bad?

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:49.170
M-Moreover, he just tried to kill me earlier...

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:52.090
I was intending to kill you before, too.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.350
This kind of stuff happens all the time. Just forget it.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.390
So this happens all the time, huh...?

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:57.800
All right, understood.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:11:59.810
There, there.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.140
Minato-san.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:04.170
What do <i>you</i> want to do?

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:05.800
M-Me?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:08.730
That's right. That's what really matters here.

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:10.240
I...

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.310
Onii-chan?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.070
Is he crying?

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.500
Tell me, is Kagari-chan crying?

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:24.250
Kuu-chan...

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.540
Will you help him?

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.460
Would you save him?

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:33.060
I don't need any of your pathetic sympathy!

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:36.750
Tsukiumi.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:41.520
The reason why you want me to wing Kagari-san...

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:42.100
...is it sympathy?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.340
You fool!

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.050
Did you really think I'd have such a lame reason?

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.270
It's revenge!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.530
I want him to get a taste of my grudge after all the preaching he gave me!

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:52.870
Also, Minato...

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:57.070
I just thought it would be wise to entrust my rival's fate to you.

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:04.190
Tsukiumi's feelings towards her rival,
and Kuu-chan's thought of wanting to help...

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.690
That's it...

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:10.960
What's important are these simple feelings that naturally flow from our hearts.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:14.260
Not because of Sekirei, nor Ashikabi...

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:18.450
But simply because we're all comrades living together here, at the Izumo Inn.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.890
I'm going after Kagari-san!

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.600
Minato-san...

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.700
It takes you too long to make a decision, Minato!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.990
However, well said.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.560
Onee-san really loves that part of you!

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:33.030
Ah! That's unfair!

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.100
What the hell do you all think you're doing?!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.140
Mina-tan.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:43.580
I thought this would happen, so I already placed a transmitter inside Homura's clothes.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.580
You'd better get going now.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.500
Before it's too late.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.230
The Scrap Number...

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:06.640
What are you doing here?!

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.900
Master ordered me...

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.500
to capture you.

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:15.650
This is the third time we're fighting each other, huh?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.950
Isn't that amazing?!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.790
This is what a Sekirei's battle looks like, right?

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.860
Are you really sure that we should leave Akitsu by herself?

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:32.980
You're pretty ungraceful, aren't you?

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:35.860
A Sekirei's battle is basically a one-on-one fight, isn't it?

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:40.860
How can you say that after having used several of them at once while trying to capture a single Sekirei?

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.810
Exceptions need to be made at certain times.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:47.140
Don't you think that things could get interesting if you obeyed the rules for once?

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.040
Well then, Landlady.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:51.980
Off we go.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.320
All right, take care.

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:56.920
Sahashi-san...

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:57.950
Y-Yes?

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:02.410
Kagari-san hasn't paid the rent for this month yet.

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:03.820
Therefore...

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.970
Please do drag him back, even if you have to tie a rope around his neck, okay?

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:07.970
I-It appeared...

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.710
W-Will do!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.670
Well, we're leaving.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.720
All right!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.430
Let's go, Minato-san.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:17.400
Huh?

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.870
As I thought, Sahashi's gone, too.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:28.480
Oh my, Seo-tan, what brings you here?

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:33.190
Well, I read the message and decided to stop by because I was worried.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.030
The truth is, we ran out of rice and miso.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.920
We thought that perhaps you could spare a bit again...

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:41.050
Both Kagari-san and Uzume-san...

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.150
Really, they don't open up to me at all.

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:45.580
If they had told me...

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:47.910
What would you have done if they had told you?

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:52.330
I would have killed Minaka myself.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:59.260
Wouldn't it turn into a monster extermination if <i>you</i> went into action?

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.890
Even Takehito-san wouldn't want that to happen.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:06.220
Right, he wouldn't want something like that to happen.

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:10.470
This Sekirei Project... it sure is a ridiculous game.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:17.460
As you already predicted, Sahashi-san is increasing the number of his Sekirei, but...

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:22.820
Matsu, you do know how cruel this could turn out to be, right?

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.620
A single Ashikabi with multiple Sekirei...

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:30.750
But, the reward is awaiting the last one remaining, right?

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.360
Actually, Miya-tan...

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:37.710
I know this isn't like me,

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:39.670
but I believe in him.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:45.350
Mina-tan will abolish the cruel rules imposed on us Sekirei, as well as our predetermined fate.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:48.850
Together with everything related to it.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.580
I think, it's something really...

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:56.970
No matter what you say, there's no way that would happen.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:03.990
Weren't you training them because you had high hopes for them, Miya-tan?

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:08.990
And you too, Seo-tan. You helped them out when Kusano-tan and Tsukiumi-tan became winged!

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.980
This and that are a different story.

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:16.540
The fact is, Musubi-san and the others are too good for Sahashi-san.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:19.960
Indeed, their breasts are an absolute waste for him...

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:22.840
Well, Mina-tan is being ill-spoken of here.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:26.180
But, that's fine.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:29.890
We'll be able to confirm soon enough that my eyes are not just a pair of bug holes.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:05.040
I see... This level of strength; no wonder you were scrap...

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:11.680
The Scrap Number, bearing an enormously dangerous power that humans were unable to control...

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:15.680
A Sekirei with its Sekirei crest on its forehead, unable to get winged!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.600
And yet, why do you have an Ashikabi?

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:23.640
You won't tell, huh?

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:24.750
Well, whatever.

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:27.660
But let me tell you one thing...

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:30.580
Put on your panties, dammit!

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:33.580
Mikogami...

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:37.100
Your fetishes are none of my business, but...

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.800
At least let her wear some panties

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:39.840
Give me a break!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.750
Akitsu did that on her own!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:45.920
I forgot to wear them...

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.590
You're too slow!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.780
Every single one of you are just too dense!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:54.430
First intruding into the bathtub, and now wearing no panties!

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:56.450
I see you're just your usual self, Kagari.

00:18:57.090 --> 00:19:00.060
No... No. 06, Homura.

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:01.480
You are...

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:06.420
Back off, Scrap Number. He's my target.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.790
Why are you here, Uzume?

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.260
Didn't I tell you already?

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.570
Uzume no longer exists.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.660
When the time comes, just pretend that Uzume doesn't exist.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.280
Uzume...

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.250
What happened to you?

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.490
Who forced you to-

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.540
Right now, I'm the Clothed Sekirei...

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.290
I hunt other Sekirei; I'm an outcast!

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:31.660
Will you come with me?

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:32.690
Otherwise...

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:37.390
you shall die.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:48.190
That's my prey...

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.110
By the master's command.

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:52.660
I won't show mercy to those who stand in my way!

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.380
Th-This is bad...

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.630
It's getting out of control again...

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:09.990
Hey, what the hell is that?

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:11.550
Whose Sekirei is it?

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:13.220
And it was just getting good!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.820
That Sekirei, he's intoxicated by his own power.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:18.740
What do you mean?

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:21.890
It seems that every now and then,
a Sekirei with unstable power output appears...

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:24.730
At this rate, he'll probably spontaneously combust.

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:32.280
H-Hello?

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.200
We're sorry, we're sorry,

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:35.950
we're terribly sorry!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:38.950
It's fine, even though you didn't pay...

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:41.640
It wasn't your fault...

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.120
Hurry up, Mina-tan!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:47.060
There are two other Sekirei around Homura-tan!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.260
It might be a bit far, but I've located another one!

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.420
So there are three of them?!

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:52.630
No...

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.910
Two more are about to make contact.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.740
As I thought, there are others heading this way as well.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:07.530
It would be great if it was Kuu-chan this time, right?

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.070
Yes!

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.450
There's another one incoming from another location.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.030
Also, three more of them are approaching as well!

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:18.270
Wh-What did you say?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.270
Onii-chan?

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.990
E-Everyone, let's hurry!

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:36.390
